{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1202890-annihilation-2018-movie-as-ctl-hedge-story","id":1202890,"title":"Annihilation 2018 movie as CtL Hedge story","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-04T00:19:21-07:00","id":1202890,"title":"Annihilation 2018 movie as CtL Hedge story","content":"<b>Notice: It\u2019s inspiration topic about movie. Spoilers after opening post are to be anticipated.</b><br /> A biologist signs up for a dangerous, secret expedition into a mysterious zone where the laws of nature don't apply. Officially it\u2019s S-F, but this zone is really making me feel of the Hedge.<br /> <br /> And here is trailer\u2026<br /> \u200b <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=89OP78l9oF0\" data-code=\"89OP78l9oF0\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/89OP78l9oF0/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T00:20:55-07:00","id":1202891,"title":"","content":"So second post \u2013 and we will deep into why this \u2018zone\u2019 is a lot like Hedge. So it\u2019s spread from normal, human \u2018infested\u2019 natural environment \u2013 and then start to CHANGE. We have \u2018noble\u2019 looking deer. We have plants that try to mimic humans. And predatory, intelligent bear. That imitates human voice! And, finally, we have whole doppelganger idea \u2013 that works A LOT like making of Fetches. Even more \u2013 \u2018zone\u2019 is changing humans entering it, making them \u2018alien\u2019 - just like CtL Hedge change humans staying there into changelings. It works with idea of Hedge the best of media as I can think about!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T01:30:40-07:00","id":1202908,"title":"","content":"I always saw the events of the film as an Idigam mucking around. Fae phenomena follow a whimsical logic of their own. Area-X, on the other hand, could not be understood, was filled with body horror and its cause literally came from outer space.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T18:32:40-07:00","id":1203225,"title":"","content":"I'm curious to see where this discussion goes.<br /> <br /> The first thing I said when I saw the trailers for the movies was that it looked like a Hedge story, and actually watching it didn't change my opinion - save that the deeper they went, the closer they got to Arcadia itself, before eventually entering it (the area immediately around the lighthouse).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T20:35:47-07:00","id":1203269,"title":"","content":"Oscar Issac's doppelg\u00e4nger is a dead ringer for a Fetch. The skull boar that screams with a woman's voice is excellent inspiration for the kind of uncanny Hedge Beasts a Keeper would send against an escaped captive. Survivors of Area X also have amnesia and a general &quot;offness&quot; that creeps out their old loved ones similar to a Changeling's experience once they leave the Hedge. However beyond that I don't see The Crawler (the alien intelligence) being a True Fae or Area X itself for that matter being part of the Hedge despite the many similarities. Area X's true nature and origin is more of a God-Machine story. <br /> <br /> (Book spoiler)<br /> In the novels, Area X is closer to a broken piece of Infrastructure operated by a very confused Angel or Exile. It's a kind of extraterrestrial biological computer trying to terraform the Earth to fit its home ecosystem but is either incapable of distinguishing between organisms or just doesn't care so it turns everything into a screaming DNA smorgasbord.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11643-corax","name":"Corax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-28T11:38:54-07:00","id":1212732,"title":"","content":"Maybe its just because my own playgroup tends to take a Machen-esque approach to the Fae, but I thought the movie Annihilation was a perfect fit for Changeling. I would even say Ventress, Anya, Josie and Lena do a good job representing the Autumn, Summer, Spring and Winter courts respectively. The themes of trauma, transformation and the fundamentally alien also felt pretty spot on. The book I saw as more a metaphor for environmental destruction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24176-borne","name":"Borne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24176_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}